            ['start_time'=>424.320,'end_time'=>426.180,'target_text'=>'So, the light is on.','source_text'=>'Jadi, lampu sudah hidup.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>426.280,'end_time'=>428.540,'target_text'=>'Now, the light is off.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, lampu sudah padam.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>428.640,'end_time'=>436.860,'target_text'=>'The light in my room is off, but my room is still bright because the light from outside is coming into my room.','source_text'=>'Lampu dalam bilik saya padam, tapi bilik saya masih terang kerana cahaya dari luar masuk ke bilik saya.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>436.960,'end_time'=>444.120,'target_text'=>'So, some very common actions that occur in the bedroom are going to bed,','source_text'=>'Jadi, beberapa tindakan yang lazim berlaku dalam bilik tidur adalah pergi tidur,','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>445.360,'end_time'=>447.720,'target_text'=>'waking up,','source_text'=>'bangun tidur,','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>448.920,'end_time'=>452.040,'target_text'=>'making my bed,','source_text'=>'mengemas katil,','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>454.520,'end_time'=>457.680,'target_text'=>'opening my curtains,','source_text'=>'membuka langsir,','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>460.240,'end_time'=>464.500,'target_text'=>'closing my curtains, [snorts] and getting dressed.','source_text'=>'menutup langsir, dan berpakaian.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>464.600,'end_time'=>468.860,'target_text'=>'So, you can see I\'m already dressed, but in the morning you are usually not dressed.','source_text'=>'Jadi, anda boleh lihat saya sudah berpakaian, tapi di waktu pagi biasanya anda belum berpakaian.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>468.960,'end_time'=>472.220,'target_text'=>'So, you go to the bathroom or the washroom.','source_text'=>'Jadi, anda pergi ke bilik mandi atau tandas.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>472.320,'end_time'=>475.500,'target_text'=>'You have a shower, you get ready, you brush your teeth, and then you get dressed.','source_text'=>'Anda mandi, anda bersedia, anda memberus gigi, kemudian anda berpakaian.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>475.600,'end_time'=>478.140,'target_text'=>'And that will be the next room we go to.','source_text'=>'Dan itulah bilik yang akan kita pergi seterusnya.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>478.240,'end_time'=>486.860,'target_text'=>'And over here you can see I have a bunch of cables, and this is just to plug my phone in at night to charge it.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini anda boleh lihat saya ada banyak kabel, ini hanya untuk sambungkan telefon saya pada waktu malam untuk cas.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>486.960,'end_time'=>492.780,'target_text'=>'And over here I have my lamp that I just turned on, and now I will turn it off.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini saya ada lampu yang baru saya hidupkan, dan sekarang saya akan padamkan ia.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>492.880,'end_time'=>501.300,'target_text'=>'Now that we\'ve learned some vocabulary, actions, and phrases in the bedroom, let\'s head over to another important room, the','source_text'=>'Sekarang selepas kita belajar kosa kata, tindakan, dan frasa dalam bilik tidur, jom kita pergi ke bilik yang penting seterusnya, iaitu','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>501.400,'end_time'=>502.260,'target_text'=>'bathroom.','source_text'=>'bilik mandi.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>502.360,'end_time'=>504.100,'target_text'=>'This is where I go first thing in the morning.','source_text'=>'Inilah tempat yang saya pergi perkara pertama di waktu pagi.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>504.200,'end_time'=>512.140,'target_text'=>'So, I go to the bathroom, I have a shower, I use the toilet, I brush my teeth, wash my face, and do all that, and I shave.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya pergi ke bilik mandi, mandi, guna tandas, gosok gigi, basuh muka, semua itu, dan saya bercukur.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>512.240,'end_time'=>515.540,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s head over to the bathroom.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jom kita pergi ke bilik mandi.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>515.640,'end_time'=>520.180,'target_text'=>'Now, on the outside of the bathroom there are two switches.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, di luar bilik mandi ada dua suis.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>520.280,'end_time'=>524.780,'target_text'=>'This bottom one is for the fan, and the top one is for the light.','source_text'=>'Yang bawah ini untuk kipas, dan yang atas untuk lampu.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>524.880,'end_time'=>527.580,'target_text'=>'So, this is my bathroom.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini bilik mandi saya.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>527.680,'end_time'=>529.300,'target_text'=>'Nothing fancy, just a normal bathroom.','source_text'=>'Tiada yang istimewa, bilik mandi biasa sahaja.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>529.400,'end_time'=>536.060,'target_text'=>'There is a sink here, a toilet, and a bathtub, and also a standing shower.','source_text'=>'Ada sinki di sini, tandas, dan tab mandi, juga pancuran berdiri.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>536.160,'end_time'=>538.180,'target_text'=>'This right here is a glass door.','source_text'=>'Ini di sini adalah pintu kaca.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>538.280,'end_time'=>541.260,'target_text'=>'You open the glass door with this handle.','source_text'=>'Anda membuka pintu kaca dengan pemegang ini.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>541.360,'end_time'=>548.580,'target_text'=>'I put my hand cloths here because there is nothing for me to hang it on the wall, although that would kind of be ideal if','source_text'=>'Saya letak tuala tangan saya di sini kerana tiada tempat untuk gantung di dinding, walaupun ia bagus kalau','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>548.680,'end_time'=>554.660,'target_text'=>'there was a couple hooks here or something I could hang my hand towels on.','source_text'=>'ada beberapa sangkut atau tempat untuk gantung tuala tangan saya.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>554.760,'end_time'=>556.460,'target_text'=>'But unfortunately, there isn\'t.','source_text'=>'Tapi malangnya tiada.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>556.560,'end_time'=>559.900,'target_text'=>'There\'s only one in the shower.','source_text'=>'Ada satu sahaja di dalam pancuran.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>560.000,'end_time'=>563.580,'target_text'=>'So, this right here, this part is my mirror.','source_text'=>'Jadi, bahagian ini adalah cermin saya.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>563.680,'end_time'=>566.320,'target_text'=>'This is my toothpaste.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah ubat gigi saya.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>566.520,'end_time'=>569.260,'target_text'=>'And I don\'t know where my toothbrush is.','source_text'=>'Dan saya tidak tahu di mana berus gigi saya.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>569.360,'end_time'=>574.060,'target_text'=>'It\'s probably in the shower cuz I like brushing my teeth when I\'m in the shower.','source_text'=>'Mungkin ada dalam pancuran sebab saya suka berus gigi semasa mandi.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>574.160,'end_time'=>575.860,'target_text'=>'I have an electric toothbrush.','source_text'=>'Saya ada berus gigi elektrik.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>575.960,'end_time'=>582.060,'target_text'=>'So, some very common actions in the bathroom are I have a shower in the bathroom.','source_text'=>'Jadi, beberapa tindakan lazim dalam bilik mandi adalah saya mandi dalam bilik mandi.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>582.160,'end_time'=>584.140,'target_text'=>'I brush my teeth in the bathroom.','source_text'=>'Saya gosok gigi dalam bilik mandi.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>584.240,'end_time'=>589.060,'target_text'=>'I use the toilet in the bathroom, or I wash my hands as well.','source_text'=>'Saya guna tandas dalam bilik mandi, atau saya juga basuh tangan.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>589.160,'end_time'=>590.420,'target_text'=>'I wash my face.','source_text'=>'Saya basuh muka.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>590.520,'end_time'=>591.820,'target_text'=>'I wash my body.','source_text'=>'Saya basuh badan.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>591.920,'end_time'=>593.420,'target_text'=>'I floss my teeth.','source_text'=>'Saya floss gigi.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>593.520,'end_time'=>594.820,'target_text'=>'I dry my hair.','source_text'=>'Saya keringkan rambut.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>594.920,'end_time'=>596.500,'target_text'=>'I dry my hands.','source_text'=>'Saya keringkan tangan.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>596.600,'end_time'=>598.060,'target_text'=>'I take a bath.','source_text'=>'Saya berendam.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>598.160,'end_time'=>599.140,'target_text'=>'I take a shower.','source_text'=>'Saya mandi (pancuran).','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>599.240,'end_time'=>605.820,'target_text'=>'There are a lot of actions you do in the bathroom, but it\'s mostly to do with personal health and hygiene.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak tindakan yang dilakukan dalam bilik mandi, tapi kebanyakannya berkaitan dengan kesihatan dan kebersihan diri.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>605.920,'end_time'=>608.980,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s have a quick quiz.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom ada kuiz ringkas.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>609.080,'end_time'=>616.420,'target_text'=>'There\'ll be three questions throughout this whole video, and I want you guys to answer them and put your answers in the comments.','source_text'=>'Akan ada tiga soalan sepanjang video ini, dan saya nak anda jawab dan letak jawapan anda dalam komen.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>616.520,'end_time'=>622.600,'target_text'=>'First question, where do you usually sleep?','source_text'=>'Soalan pertama, di mana anda biasanya tidur?','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>623.920,'end_time'=>626.900,'target_text'=>'Where do you usually sleep?','source_text'=>'Di mana anda biasanya tidur?','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>627.000,'end_time'=>629.980,'target_text'=>'Put your answers in the comments.','source_text'=>'Letak jawapan anda dalam komen.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>630.080,'end_time'=>633.540,'target_text'=>'Second question, which sentence is correct?','source_text'=>'Soalan kedua, ayat manakah yang betul?','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>633.640,'end_time'=>638.500,'target_text'=>'I make a shower, I take a shower, or I do a shower.','source_text'=>'Saya \'make a shower\', saya \'take a shower\', atau saya \'do a shower\'.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>638.600,'end_time'=>641.580,'target_text'=>'Which sentence is correct?','source_text'=>'Ayat manakah yang betul?','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>641.680,'end_time'=>643.740,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya dalam komen.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>643.840,'end_time'=>647.420,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s move over to the kitchen.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita pindah ke dapur.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>647.520,'end_time'=>649.060,'target_text'=>'Now, we are in the kitchen.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, kita berada di dapur.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>649.160,'end_time'=>652.820,'target_text'=>'This is the area where you cook.','source_text'=>'Inilah kawasan tempat anda memasak.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>652.920,'end_time'=>658.060,'target_text'=>'Sometimes it\'s its own room, but this is more of an open concept kitchen.','source_text'=>'Kadang-kadang ia bilik tersendiri, tapi ini adalah dapur konsep terbuka.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>658.160,'end_time'=>661.540,'target_text'=>'So, you can see the living room and the dining room from the kitchen.','source_text'=>'Jadi, anda boleh lihat ruang tamu dan ruang makan dari dapur.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>661.640,'end_time'=>662.980,'target_text'=>'This is something I prefer.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah sesuatu yang saya suka.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>663.080,'end_time'=>664.620,'target_text'=>'Tell me, what do you guys prefer?','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya, apa yang anda suka?','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>664.720,'end_time'=>672.020,'target_text'=>'Do you prefer open concept kitchens where you can see the dining room, living room, and other parts of your home, or do you','source_text'=>'Adakah anda suka dapur konsep terbuka di mana anda boleh lihat ruang makan, ruang tamu, dan bahagian lain rumah anda, atau anda','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>672.120,'end_time'=>674.300,'target_text'=>'prefer kitchens that are in their own room?','source_text'=>'lebih suka dapur yang ada dalam biliknya sendiri?','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>674.400,'end_time'=>677.860,'target_text'=>'I prefer this because it feels more open and like there is more space.','source_text'=>'Saya suka ini kerana ia terasa lebih luas dan ada lebih banyak ruang.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>677.960,'end_time'=>683.460,'target_text'=>'If it was closed off here with a wall and a wall, it would feel so so small.','source_text'=>'Kalau ia ditutup dengan dinding di sini dan dinding di sana, ia akan terasa sangat sempit.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>683.560,'end_time'=>690.340,'target_text'=>'If there\'s like a wall here, a wall there, and that was just the entrance, it would just feel so small, congested, and I would','source_text'=>'Kalau ada dinding di sini, dinding di sana, dan itu sahaja pintu masuknya, ia akan terasa sangat sempit, sesak, dan saya akan','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>690.440,'end_time'=>693.300,'target_text'=>'feel like claustrophobic in here.','source_text'=>'rasa seperti fobia dalam tempat sempit.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>693.400,'end_time'=>695.020,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m glad it\'s open.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya gembira ia terbuka.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>695.120,'end_time'=>696.380,'target_text'=>'It\'s a lot nicer.','source_text'=>'Ia jauh lebih bagus.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>696.480,'end_time'=>699.900,'target_text'=>'Anyway, this right here is called a range hood.','source_text'=>'Anyway, ini di sini dipanggil tudung dapur (range hood).','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>700.000,'end_time'=>704.020,'target_text'=>'The range hood is silver and made out of metal.','source_text'=>'Tudung dapur itu berwarna perak dan diperbuat daripada logam.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>704.120,'end_time'=>705.540,'target_text'=>'Now, I\'m pretty sure it doesn\'t work.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, saya agak pasti ia tidak berfungsi.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>705.640,'end_time'=>709.780,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think this sucks any air or anything out.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia tidak menyedut udara ke luar.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>709.880,'end_time'=>712.060,'target_text'=>'And if it does, then I don\'t know how to turn it on.','source_text'=>'Dan kalau ia berfungsi pun, saya tak tahu macam mana nak hidupkannya.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>712.160,'end_time'=>713.900,'target_text'=>'But, I\'m pretty sure it doesn\'t.','source_text'=>'Tapi, saya agak pasti ia tidak berfungsi.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>714.000,'end_time'=>715.460,'target_text'=>'This right here is a stove top.','source_text'=>'Ini di sini adalah dapur elektrik (stove top).','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>715.560,'end_time'=>719.940,'target_text'=>'This is an electric stove top, so it doesn\'t work with gas.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah dapur elektrik, jadi ia tidak menggunakan gas.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>720.040,'end_time'=>721.820,'target_text'=>'Instead, it works with power.','source_text'=>'Sebaliknya, ia menggunakan elektrik.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>721.920,'end_time'=>723.620,'target_text'=>'So, you turn it on there.','source_text'=>'Jadi, anda hidupkan di sana.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>723.720,'end_time'=>728.260,'target_text'=>'You adjust your temperature and you cook your food like that.','source_text'=>'Anda laraskan suhu dan anda masak makanan anda begitu.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>728.360,'end_time'=>729.820,'target_text'=>'This right here is my blender.','source_text'=>'Ini di sini adalah pengisar (blender) saya.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>729.920,'end_time'=>733.340,'target_text'=>'I bought this in a previous video where I went grocery shopping.','source_text'=>'Saya beli ini dalam video sebelumnya semasa saya pergi membeli-belah bahan makanan.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>733.440,'end_time'=>735.180,'target_text'=>'But, yeah, this is my blender.','source_text'=>'Tapi, ya, ini pengisar saya.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>735.280,'end_time'=>737.380,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually works quite nicely.','source_text'=>'Ia sebenarnya berfungsi dengan baik.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>737.480,'end_time'=>741.420,'target_text'=>'And it doesn\'t smoke and blow up like the other one.','source_text'=>'Dan ia tidak berasap dan meletup seperti yang satu lagi.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>741.520,'end_time'=>746.140,'target_text'=>'The other blender I had, I told you guys I was running it, it just started smoking, smoking, smoking.','source_text'=>'Pengisar lama yang saya ada, saya dah cerita kat korang, saya hidupkan ia, ia mula berasap, berasap, berasap.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>746.240,'end_time'=>747.940,'target_text'=>'Pretty sure a fire started in it.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa api mula menyala di dalamnya.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>748.040,'end_time'=>752.060,'target_text'=>'So, I threw it in the sink, put a bunch of water on it, and then I threw it out.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya campak ia ke sinki, siram banyak air ke atasnya, kemudian saya buang ia.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>752.160,'end_time'=>755.780,'target_text'=>'So, I had to get a new one, but this is a good brand, Philips.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya terpaksa beli yang baru, tapi ini jenama yang baik, Philips.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>755.880,'end_time'=>757.380,'target_text'=>'That is the brand name, Philips.','source_text'=>'Itulah nama jenamanya, Philips.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>757.480,'end_time'=>759.260,'target_text'=>'So, that blender is a lot better.','source_text'=>'Jadi, pengisar itu jauh lebih baik.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>759.360,'end_time'=>761.660,'target_text'=>'And it\'s just plastic.','source_text'=>'Dan ia diperbuat daripada plastik sahaja.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>761.760,'end_time'=>762.380,'target_text'=>'So, yeah.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ya.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>762.480,'end_time'=>764.900,'target_text'=>'This right here is a small kitchen scale.','source_text'=>'Ini di sini adalah penimbang dapur yang kecil.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>765.000,'end_time'=>772.700,'target_text'=>'You see kitchen scale, and this is just to weigh, you know, different products, so you know how much something weighs ingredient-wise.','source_text'=>'Penimbang dapur, ini untuk menimbang pelbagai produk, supaya anda tahu berat sesuatu bahan makanan.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>772.800,'end_time'=>775.540,'target_text'=>'Over here, we have our sink.','source_text'=>'Di sini, kita ada sinki.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>775.640,'end_time'=>779.140,'target_text'=>'This is a faucet, and the faucet is extendable.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah paip, dan paip ini boleh dipanjangkan.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>779.240,'end_time'=>781.980,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s nice.','source_text'=>'Jadi, itu bagus.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>782.080,'end_time'=>784.340,'target_text'=>'Over here, we have two pots that are drying.','source_text'=>'Di sini, kita ada dua periuk yang sedang dikeringkan.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>784.440,'end_time'=>786.860,'target_text'=>'Up top, we have four plates.','source_text'=>'Di atas, kita ada empat pinggan.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>786.960,'end_time'=>791.180,'target_text'=>'And here is where we keep all our cutlery and knives.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini tempat kita simpan semua peralatan makan dan pisau.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>791.280,'end_time'=>791.900,'target_text'=>'Give me your hand.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya tangan anda.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>792.000,'end_time'=>792.980,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, hell no.','source_text'=>'Eh, tidak mahu lah.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>793.080,'end_time'=>794.180,'target_text'=>'>> I got this.','source_text'=>'Saya boleh buat.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>794.280,'end_time'=>795.940,'target_text'=>'>> I am slicing them.','source_text'=>'Saya sedang menghiris.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>796.040,'end_time'=>802.180,'target_text'=>'These containers are my yogurt containers, but I do I do like keeping these containers cuz I do find them pretty useful.','source_text'=>'Bekas-bekas ini adalah bekas yogurt saya, tapi saya suka simpan bekas-bekas ini kerana saya rasa ia agak berguna.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>802.280,'end_time'=>806.300,'target_text'=>'In Canada, I know we always keep them because sometimes','source_text'=>'Di Kanada, saya tahu kami selalu simpan bekas-bekas ini kerana kadang-kadang','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>806.400,'end_time'=>812.940,'target_text'=>'we put stuff in here if we run out of normal plastic containers, or we use them as like a measuring cup for our dog food.','source_text'=>'kami letak barang dalam sini kalau kehabisan bekas plastik biasa, atau kami guna ia seperti cawan sukatan untuk makanan anjing.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>813.040,'end_time'=>819.100,'target_text'=>'Cuz we have like we have like three big dogs, and we get these big bags of dog food, and we\'re like, "How much do we feed','source_text'=>'Sebab kami ada lebih kurang tiga ekor anjing besar, dan kami dapat beg besar makanan anjing, lalu kami fikir, berapa banyak yang perlu kami bagi','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>819.200,'end_time'=>821.660,'target_text'=>'them?" And we feed them a couple of cups of these each.','source_text'=>'mereka makan? Dan kami bagi mereka beberapa cawan ini setiap satu.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>821.760,'end_time'=>823.820,'target_text'=>'So, one scoop, two scoops.','source_text'=>'Jadi, satu cedok, dua cedok.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>823.920,'end_time'=>828.480,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s an easy way to measure the dog food out, and it\'s a nice container.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ia cara mudah untuk menyukat makanan anjing, dan ia bekas yang bagus.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>828.580,'end_time'=>831.660,'target_text'=>'>> [snorts] >> Over here, up top, we have cupboards.','source_text'=>'Di sini, di atas, kita ada almari dapur (cupboards).','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>831.760,'end_time'=>833.660,'target_text'=>'Also on the bottom, we have a lot of cupboards.','source_text'=>'Juga di bahagian bawah, kita ada banyak almari dapur.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>833.760,'end_time'=>836.620,'target_text'=>'There are no drawers here, only cupboards.','source_text'=>'Tiada laci di sini, hanya almari dapur.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>836.720,'end_time'=>838.340,'target_text'=>'Drawers are the ones you pull out.','source_text'=>'Laci adalah yang anda tarik keluar.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>838.440,'end_time'=>843.500,'target_text'=>'Cupboards are the ones you open up like this, and there are shelves inside.','source_text'=>'Almari dapur adalah yang anda buka seperti ini, dan ada rak-rak di dalamnya.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>843.600,'end_time'=>844.780,'target_text'=>'You can see it\'s pretty empty.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh lihat ia agak kosong.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>844.880,'end_time'=>847.500,'target_text'=>'Oh, honestly, I forgot I had these eggs.','source_text'=>'Oh, sebenarnya, saya lupa saya ada telur-telur ini.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>847.600,'end_time'=>850.780,'target_text'=>'Low-key, I should cook cook some eggs, boil them.','source_text'=>'Agaknya patut saya masak telur-telur ini, rebus.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>850.880,'end_time'=>854.420,'target_text'=>'Last time I boiled all these eggs, and I forgot to eat them.','source_text'=>'Kali terakhir saya rebus semua telur ini, dan saya lupa nak makan.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>854.520,'end_time'=>856.980,'target_text'=>'This time, I\'ll only boil like couple at a time.','source_text'=>'Kali ini, saya rebus dua tiga biji je sekali.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>857.080,'end_time'=>858.900,'target_text'=>'But, yeah, I should boil some eggs, though.','source_text'=>'Tapi, ya, memang patut saya rebus telur.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>859.000,'end_time'=>864.420,'target_text'=>'Also, let me know if you\'re from Japan, Japanese curry is one of my favorite dishes ever, dude.','source_text'=>'Juga, beritahu saya kalau anda dari Jepun, kari Jepun adalah salah satu hidangan kegemaran saya, kawan.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>864.520,'end_time'=>869.800,'target_text'=>'I love Japanese curry so much, like with tonkatsu.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat suka kari Jepun, dengan tonkatsu.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>871.400,'end_time'=>872.340,'target_text'=>'So good.','source_text'=>'Sedap sangat.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>872.440,'end_time'=>873.460,'target_text'=>'It\'s so good.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat sedap.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>873.560,'end_time'=>875.700,'target_text'=>'Japanese curry, man, is really, really good.','source_text'=>'Kari Jepun, kawan, memang sedap betul.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>875.800,'end_time'=>877.100,'target_text'=>'I love love that.','source_text'=>'Saya suka sangat.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>877.200,'end_time'=>877.780,'target_text'=>'Actually, I got two.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya, saya ada dua.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>877.880,'end_time'=>879.860,'target_text'=>'I got this one, too.','source_text'=>'Saya dapat yang ini juga.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>879.960,'end_time'=>880.940,'target_text'=>'Shout out Japan.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih Jepun.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>881.040,'end_time'=>887.060,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, some actions you do in the kitchen are Before I answer, leave them in the comments.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ya, beberapa tindakan yang anda lakukan dalam dapur — sebelum saya jawab, letak dalam komen.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>887.160,'end_time'=>895.440,'target_text'=>'What actions can you think of right now off the top of your head that you do every time you are in the kitchen?','source_text'=>'Tindakan apa yang terlintas di fikiran anda sekarang yang anda lakukan setiap kali berada dalam dapur?','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>895.560,'end_time'=>898.380,'target_text'=>'You wash dishes in the kitchen.','source_text'=>'Anda basuh pinggan dalam dapur.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>898.480,'end_time'=>904.820,'target_text'=>'You cook, or I cook, or I\'m cooking in the kitchen, or I just finished cooking.','source_text'=>'Anda memasak, atau saya memasak, atau saya sedang memasak dalam dapur, atau saya baru selesai memasak.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>904.920,'end_time'=>910.940,'target_text'=>'I also open the fridge door, and I grab ingredients from the fridge.','source_text'=>'Saya juga membuka pintu peti sejuk, dan saya ambil bahan-bahan dari peti sejuk.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>911.040,'end_time'=>912.700,'target_text'=>'Same thing with the freezer.','source_text'=>'Sama juga dengan peti ais.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>912.800,'end_time'=>915.780,'target_text'=>'I grab ingredients out of my freezer to cook.','source_text'=>'Saya ambil bahan-bahan dari peti ais untuk memasak.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>915.880,'end_time'=>922.900,'target_text'=>'The freezer freezes my food, so I need to warm it up for longer if I want it to be room temperature.','source_text'=>'Peti ais membekukan makanan saya, jadi saya perlu panaskan lebih lama kalau nak ia jadi suhu bilik.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>923.000,'end_time'=>926.100,'target_text'=>'The fridge just keeps it cool and fresh.','source_text'=>'Peti sejuk hanya menyejukkan dan mengekalkan kesegaran makanan.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>926.200,'end_time'=>930.660,'target_text'=>'Also in the kitchen, you can warm things up with a microwave.','source_text'=>'Juga dalam dapur, anda boleh panaskan makanan dengan ketuhar gelombang mikro.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>930.760,'end_time'=>935.540,'target_text'=>'You can also cook rice in a rice cooker, or you can boil water in a kettle.','source_text'=>'Anda juga boleh masak nasi dalam periuk nasi, atau rebus air dalam cerek.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>935.640,'end_time'=>936.900,'target_text'=>'This is a kettle.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah cerek.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>937.000,'end_time'=>940.180,'target_text'=>'So, there are many things you can do in a kitchen.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ada banyak perkara yang boleh anda lakukan dalam dapur.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>940.280,'end_time'=>944.340,'target_text'=>'But, mainly a kitchen is used to make food and eat it.','source_text'=>'Tapi, utamanya dapur digunakan untuk menyediakan makanan dan memakannya.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>944.440,'end_time'=>949.900,'target_text'=>'And also to clean up after you\'ve finished preparing and cooking your food.','source_text'=>'Dan juga untuk membersihkan selepas anda selesai menyediakan dan memasak makanan.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>950.000,'end_time'=>953.140,'target_text'=>'Don\'t just watch this lesson and forget it.','source_text'=>'Jangan sekadar tengok pelajaran ini dan lupa.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>953.240,'end_time'=>960.460,'target_text'=>'Get the workbook for this video on my website and practice everything from the lesson more deeply.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku kerja untuk video ini di laman web saya dan praktikkan semua perkara dari pelajaran ini dengan lebih mendalam.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>960.560,'end_time'=>970.140,'target_text'=>'Inside, you\'ll review the grammar, vocabulary, tenses, sentence patterns, comprehension questions, and real English from this','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya, anda akan mengulang kaji tatabahasa, kosa kata, kala, pola ayat, soalan pemahaman, dan Bahasa Inggeris nyata dari video ini','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>970.240,'end_time'=>974.580,'target_text'=>'video with clear explanations and exercises.','source_text'=>'dengan penjelasan dan latihan yang jelas.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>974.680,'end_time'=>979.900,'target_text'=>'Watching helps you understand, but practicing helps you remember.','source_text'=>'Menonton membantu anda faham, tapi berlatih membantu anda ingat.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>980.000,'end_time'=>985.180,'target_text'=>'And when you buy five or more workbooks, you automatically get 30% off at checkout.','source_text'=>'Dan apabila anda beli lima atau lebih buku kerja, anda secara automatik mendapat diskaun 30% semasa pembayaran.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>985.280,'end_time'=>988.940,'target_text'=>'The link is in the description or at vulcaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Pautan ada dalam penerangan atau di vulcaenglish.com.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>989.040,'end_time'=>990.920,'target_text'=>'So, now','source_text'=>'Jadi, sekarang','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>991.680,'end_time'=>994.340,'target_text'=>'we\'re moving to the dining table.','source_text'=>'kita berpindah ke meja makan.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>994.440,'end_time'=>997.660,'target_text'=>'So, this is a dining table, and this is where you eat food.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini adalah meja makan, dan di sinilah tempat anda makan.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>997.760,'end_time'=>1002.340,'target_text'=>'And here we have a fork, a knife, and a spoon.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini kita ada garpu, pisau, dan sudu.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>1002.440,'end_time'=>1004.660,'target_text'=>'You can have two different types of spoons.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh ada dua jenis sudu yang berbeza.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>1004.760,'end_time'=>1006.500,'target_text'=>'This is a tablespoon.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah sudu makan besar (tablespoon).','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>1006.600,'end_time'=>1010.140,'target_text'=>'But, the smaller version is called a teaspoon.','source_text'=>'Tapi, versi yang lebih kecil dipanggil sudu teh (teaspoon).','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>1010.240,'end_time'=>1011.740,'target_text'=>'This right here is a plate.','source_text'=>'Ini di sini adalah pinggan.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>1011.840,'end_time'=>1016.180,'target_text'=>'The one that is kind of like this shape is called a bowl.','source_text'=>'Yang berbentuk seperti ini dipanggil mangkuk.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>1016.280,'end_time'=>1017.580,'target_text'=>'This is a plate.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah pinggan.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>1017.680,'end_time'=>1020.260,'target_text'=>'And this is a glass.','source_text'=>'Dan ini adalah gelas.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>1020.360,'end_time'=>1022.540,'target_text'=>'Because it is made out of glass.','source_text'=>'Kerana ia diperbuat daripada kaca.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>1022.640,'end_time'=>1025.940,'target_text'=>'This right here is my dining table.','source_text'=>'Ini di sini adalah meja makan saya.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>1026.040,'end_time'=>1027.340,'target_text'=>'These are my chairs.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah kerusi-kerusi saya.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>1027.440,'end_time'=>1031.820,'target_text'=>'There are four chairs here, two on each side of the dining table.','source_text'=>'Ada empat kerusi di sini, dua di setiap sisi meja makan.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>1031.920,'end_time'=>1037.860,'target_text'=>'Over here, we have a window, but we can\'t see anything because there is a curtain blocking our view.','source_text'=>'Di sini, kita ada tingkap, tapi kita tidak boleh nampak apa-apa kerana ada langsir yang menghalang pandangan.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>1037.960,'end_time'=>1043.900,'target_text'=>'But this is also for privacy because there\'s nothing really here besides the other apartment on the other side.','source_text'=>'Tapi ini juga untuk privasi kerana tidak ada apa-apa di sana selain apartment lain di sebelah.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>1044.000,'end_time'=>1046.620,'target_text'=>'So, if it was open, they would just be able to see us.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kalau dibuka, mereka boleh nampak kita.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>1046.720,'end_time'=>1050.500,'target_text'=>'But it\'s just a open area in the middle of the apartment building.','source_text'=>'Tapi ia hanya kawasan terbuka di tengah-tengah bangunan apartment.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>1050.600,'end_time'=>1052.700,'target_text'=>'And up top here, we have some lights.','source_text'=>'Dan di atas sini, kita ada beberapa lampu.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>1052.800,'end_time'=>1057.460,'target_text'=>'Two of these lights are blue LEDs and the third one is a yellow light.','source_text'=>'Dua lampu ini berwarna biru LED dan yang ketiga adalah lampu kuning.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>1057.560,'end_time'=>1060.260,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s kind of mismatched a little bit there.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ia sedikit tidak sepadanan.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>1060.360,'end_time'=>1063.860,'target_text'=>'And on the side here, we have some napkins','source_text'=>'Dan di sebelah sini, kita ada beberapa tisu','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>1063.960,'end_time'=>1069.260,'target_text'=>'and some spices, salt, pepper, and paprika, and also some sugar and a banana.','source_text'=>'dan beberapa rempah, garam, lada, paprika, juga gula dan pisang.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>1069.360,'end_time'=>1071.940,'target_text'=>'And over here, we have a lot of rice cakes.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini, kita ada banyak keropok beras.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>1072.040,'end_time'=>1073.820,'target_text'=>'Rice cakes or rice crackers.','source_text'=>'Keropok beras.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>1073.920,'end_time'=>1075.300,'target_text'=>'Third question.','source_text'=>'Soalan ketiga.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>1075.400,'end_time'=>1078.860,'target_text'=>'Which sentence is most natural?','source_text'=>'Ayat manakah yang paling semula jadi?','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>1078.960,'end_time'=>1081.140,'target_text'=>'I sit on the table and eat dinner.','source_text'=>'Saya duduk atas meja dan makan malam.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>1081.240,'end_time'=>1083.740,'target_text'=>'I sit at the table and eat dinner.','source_text'=>'Saya duduk di meja dan makan malam.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>1083.840,'end_time'=>1087.420,'target_text'=>'Or I sit inside the table and eat dinner.','source_text'=>'Atau saya duduk dalam meja dan makan malam.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>1087.520,'end_time'=>1089.940,'target_text'=>'Leave your answers in the comments.','source_text'=>'Letak jawapan anda dalam komen.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>1090.040,'end_time'=>1092.540,'target_text'=>'Now, I\'m in my living room.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, saya berada dalam ruang tamu saya.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>1092.640,'end_time'=>1096.260,'target_text'=>'This behind me is called a sofa or a couch.','source_text'=>'Di belakang saya ini dipanggil sofa atau kerusi panjang.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>1096.360,'end_time'=>1098.700,'target_text'=>'These are called pillows.','source_text'=>'Ini dipanggil bantal-bantal.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>1098.800,'end_time'=>1100.620,'target_text'=>'This is a coffee table.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah meja kopi.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>1100.720,'end_time'=>1103.460,'target_text'=>'A glass coffee table.','source_text'=>'Meja kopi berkaca.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>1103.560,'end_time'=>1106.500,'target_text'=>'This is a TV remote.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah alat kawalan jauh TV.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>1106.600,'end_time'=>1113.580,'target_text'=>'There are many buttons on the TV remote, but the main one is to turn it on, the main red button.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak butang pada alat kawalan jauh TV, tapi yang utama adalah untuk menghidupkannya, butang merah utama.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>1113.680,'end_time'=>1118.540,'target_text'=>'There are also more buttons to change the channel or to change the volume.','source_text'=>'Ada juga lebih banyak butang untuk tukar saluran atau tukar kelantangan.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>1118.640,'end_time'=>1122.060,'target_text'=>'So, this is a TV remote.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini adalah alat kawalan jauh TV.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>1122.160,'end_time'=>1124.940,'target_text'=>'And over here, this is a TV.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini, ini adalah TV.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>1125.040,'end_time'=>1125.440,'target_text'=>'A TV.','source_text'=>'TV.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>1125.520,'end_time'=>1126.980,'target_text'=>'Right now, the TV is off.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, TV sedang padam.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>1127.080,'end_time'=>1129.980,'target_text'=>'You can tell because the screen is completely black.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh tahu sebab skrinnya hitam sepenuhnya.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>1130.080,'end_time'=>1138.340,'target_text'=>'And on this side, we have some paintings, some cupboards, some storage space, an air conditioner, and here we have a fan.','source_text'=>'Dan di sebelah ini, kita ada beberapa lukisan, beberapa almari, ruang simpanan, penghawa dingin, dan di sini kita ada kipas.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>1138.440,'end_time'=>1141.780,'target_text'=>'This is just to keep the living room cool.','source_text'=>'Ini hanya untuk menyejukkan ruang tamu.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>1141.880,'end_time'=>1142.700,'target_text'=>'Cool.','source_text'=>'Sejuk.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>1142.800,'end_time'=>1149.220,'target_text'=>'So, some common actions in a living room are I sit down on the sofa.','source_text'=>'Jadi, beberapa tindakan biasa dalam ruang tamu adalah saya duduk di sofa.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>1149.320,'end_time'=>1156.460,'target_text'=>'I pick up the TV remote and I turn on the TV and I play my favorite show on the TV.','source_text'=>'Saya ambil alat kawalan jauh TV dan saya hidupkan TV dan saya tonton rancangan kegemaran saya.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>1156.560,'end_time'=>1159.500,'target_text'=>'Now you can see the TV is turning on.','source_text'=>'Sekarang anda boleh lihat TV sedang hidup.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>1159.600,'end_time'=>1161.980,'target_text'=>'>> Are you going to play 90 Day Fiancé?','source_text'=>'Anda nak tonton 90 Day Fiancé?','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>1162.080,'end_time'=>1162.540,'target_text'=>'>> Facts.','source_text'=>'Betul.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>1162.640,'end_time'=>1165.260,'target_text'=>'[screaming] I\'ll play 90 Day Fiancé.','source_text'=>'Saya akan tonton 90 Day Fiancé.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>1165.360,'end_time'=>1171.220,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments if you guys have ever watched the show 90 Day Fiancé.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya dalam komen kalau anda pernah tonton rancangan 90 Day Fiancé.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>1171.320,'end_time'=>1179.100,'target_text'=>'I know my parents watch it a lot and I\'ve never really watched it myself, but recently I\'ve started watching it and it\'s actually','source_text'=>'Saya tahu ibu bapa saya selalu tonton dan saya tak pernah tonton sendiri, tapi baru-baru ini saya mula tonton dan ia sebenarnya','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>1179.200,'end_time'=>1180.060,'target_text'=>'pretty entertaining.','source_text'=>'agak menghiburkan.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>1180.160,'end_time'=>1181.500,'target_text'=>'I\'m not going to lie.','source_text'=>'Saya tak nak tipu.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>1181.600,'end_time'=>1184.820,'target_text'=>'Some of the people on there on 90 Day Fiancé blow my mind.','source_text'=>'Sesetengah orang dalam 90 Day Fiancé membuatkan saya terpegun.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>1184.920,'end_time'=>1188.900,'target_text'=>'I think there are 12 seasons and right now I\'m just watching season 12 like the most recent one.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ada 12 musim dan sekarang saya tengah tonton musim 12, yang paling terkini.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>1189.000,'end_time'=>1190.900,'target_text'=>'They\'re still airing episodes.','source_text'=>'Mereka masih menayangkan episod-episod.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>1191.000,'end_time'=>1195.220,'target_text'=>'But some of those people are comically like are they real?','source_text'=>'Tapi sesetengah orang dalam rancangan tu memang lawak — adakah mereka betul-betul wujud?','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>1195.320,'end_time'=>1198.580,'target_text'=>'Is like sometimes what I think to myself like are they acting?','source_text'=>'Kadang-kadang saya fikir sendiri — adakah mereka berlakon?','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>1198.680,'end_time'=>1202.980,'target_text'=>'Is this like a character that they\'re playing or is this like really how they are?','source_text'=>'Adakah ini watak yang mereka mainkan atau memang beginilah perangai mereka sebenarnya?','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>1203.080,'end_time'=>1205.520,'target_text'=>'Cuz some people men','source_text'=>'Sebab sesetengah orang memang','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>1205.720,'end_time'=>1212.340,'target_text'=>'blow my mind cuz I mean they obviously try to find I think the most extreme people that are like have like the most extreme','source_text'=>'membuatkan saya terpegun sebab mereka jelas cuba cari orang yang paling melampau dengan situasi atau personaliti atau watak yang paling ekstrem,','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>1212.440,'end_time'=>1215.140,'target_text'=>'situation or personality or character, you know?','source_text'=>'kan?','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>1215.240,'end_time'=>1219.820,'target_text'=>'They\'re not going to choose the most normal, mundane, run-of-the-mill Joe Schmo people, right?','source_text'=>'Mereka tidak akan pilih orang yang paling biasa dan membosankan, kan?','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>1219.920,'end_time'=>1223.780,'target_text'=>'They\'re going to choose people that are like a little bit a little bit off their rocker, you know?','source_text'=>'Mereka akan pilih orang yang agak luar biasa sikit, kan?','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>1223.880,'end_time'=>1225.540,'target_text'=>'And it\'s it\'s entertaining.','source_text'=>'Dan ia memang menghiburkan.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>1225.640,'end_time'=>1226.700,'target_text'=>'It\'s really entertaining.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat menghiburkan.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>1226.800,'end_time'=>1230.480,'target_text'=>'Now I\'ll turn the TV off.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan padamkan TV.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>1231.160,'end_time'=>1237.380,'target_text'=>'So in the living room you can sit back, relax, kick your feet up, and just relax, you know?','source_text'=>'Jadi dalam ruang tamu anda boleh duduk dengan selesa, angkat kaki, dan berehat, kan?','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>1237.480,'end_time'=>1238.340,'target_text'=>'Take a break.','source_text'=>'Berehat.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>1238.440,'end_time'=>1246.740,'target_text'=>'Usually you come here after a long day of work when you just want to relax, watch a show, wind down, and spend time either','source_text'=>'Biasanya anda datang ke sini selepas hari kerja yang panjang bila anda nak berehat, tonton rancangan, bertenang, dan luangkan masa sama ada','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>1246.840,'end_time'=>1251.580,'target_text'=>'with your family, your friends, or your partner, or anyone, or alone.','source_text'=>'dengan keluarga, kawan, atau pasangan, atau sesiapa sahaja, atau bersendirian.','order'=>339],
