            ['start_time'=>1307.480,'end_time'=>1312.580,'target_text'=>'The only time I really like have the urge to like go outside and do things is when it\'s around 25°.','source_text'=>'Satu-satunya masa saya betul-betul rasa nak keluar dan buat sesuatu adalah bila suhu dalam 25°.','order'=>423],
