            ['start_time'=>1352.120,'end_time'=>1359.540,'target_text'=>'You\'ll practice pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking with step-by-step video lessons.','source_text'=>'Anda akan berlatih sebutan, loghat, rentak, dan pertuturan semula jadi dengan pelajaran video langkah demi langkah.','order'=>438],
