            ['start_time'=>194.520,'end_time'=>201.340,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, now we are walking up this very big driveway to a monument here.','source_text'=>'Okay, sekarang kita sedang berjalan naik melalui jalan masuk yang besar ini ke sebuah monumen di sini.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>201.440,'end_time'=>207.180,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if you can see that monument in in the distance, but it is one of the most famous monuments here in Jakarta,','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti jika anda boleh nampak monumen itu di kejauhan, tetapi ia adalah salah satu monumen paling terkenal di Jakarta,','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>207.280,'end_time'=>209.780,'target_text'=>'Indonesia, and we are going to go look at it right now.','source_text'=>'Indonesia, dan kita akan pergi melihatnya sekarang.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>209.880,'end_time'=>213.900,'target_text'=>'But let\'s describe a little bit on the way there and talk about emotions.','source_text'=>'Tapi mari kita terangkan serba sedikit sepanjang perjalanan ke sana sambil berbincang tentang emosi.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>214.000,'end_time'=>218.180,'target_text'=>'So, can you guys tell me what the opposite of happy is?','source_text'=>'Jadi, bolehkah anda beritahu saya apa lawan bagi gembira?','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>218.280,'end_time'=>220.980,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m happy to be in Jakarta.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya gembira berada di Jakarta.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>221.080,'end_time'=>223.180,'target_text'=>'What would be the opposite of that?','source_text'=>'Apakah lawan baginya?','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>223.280,'end_time'=>224.380,'target_text'=>'>> Sad.','source_text'=>'Sedih.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>224.480,'end_time'=>225.300,'target_text'=>'>> Correct.','source_text'=>'Betul.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>225.400,'end_time'=>226.100,'target_text'=>'Sad.','source_text'=>'Sedih.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>226.200,'end_time'=>228.100,'target_text'=>'I am sad today.','source_text'=>'Saya sedih hari ini.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>228.200,'end_time'=>229.420,'target_text'=>'I\'m sad this happened.','source_text'=>'Saya sedih perkara ini berlaku.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>229.520,'end_time'=>231.420,'target_text'=>'So, the So the is sad.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jawapannya adalah sedih.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>231.520,'end_time'=>238.100,'target_text'=>'Those are probably two of the most common emotions you will ever hear and use.','source_text'=>'Itu mungkin dua emosi paling biasa yang akan anda dengar dan gunakan.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>238.200,'end_time'=>240.020,'target_text'=>'Talk a little bit around us now.','source_text'=>'Bercakap sedikit tentang keadaan sekeliling kita sekarang.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>240.120,'end_time'=>241.420,'target_text'=>'Look at this path.','source_text'=>'Lihat laluan ini.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>241.520,'end_time'=>244.660,'target_text'=>'This path is very old and it\'s very uneven.','source_text'=>'Laluan ini sangat lama dan sangat tidak rata.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>244.760,'end_time'=>248.980,'target_text'=>'You can easily trip and it is missing pieces of stone.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh terjatuh dengan mudah dan ia kekurangan kepingan batu.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>249.080,'end_time'=>251.980,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think you could push a wheelchair on here.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kerusi roda tidak boleh ditolak di sini.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>252.080,'end_time'=>253.900,'target_text'=>'I think it will be very difficult.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia akan menjadi sangat sukar.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>254.000,'end_time'=>261.260,'target_text'=>'People in wheelchairs probably get sad when they have to come on here because it\'s so bumpy and it probably hurts.','source_text'=>'Orang berkerusi roda mungkin berasa sedih apabila terpaksa lalu di sini kerana ia sangat berbonggol-bonggol dan mungkin menyakitkan.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>261.360,'end_time'=>262.340,'target_text'=>'Do you agree?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda setuju?','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>262.440,'end_time'=>263.060,'target_text'=>'>> I agree.','source_text'=>'Saya setuju.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>263.160,'end_time'=>265.420,'target_text'=>'Maybe they get a little disappointed as well.','source_text'=>'Mungkin mereka berasa sedikit kecewa juga.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>265.520,'end_time'=>269.180,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they probably get disappointed too and maybe frustrated.','source_text'=>'Ya, mereka mungkin berasa kecewa dan mungkin kecewa juga.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>269.280,'end_time'=>275.940,'target_text'=>'They\'re like, "Why is this path not smooth for people in wheelchairs?" If they really wanted to though, they could go on the','source_text'=>'Mereka fikir, \'Kenapa laluan ini tidak rata untuk orang berkerusi roda?\' Tapi jika mereka mahu, mereka boleh menggunakan','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>276.040,'end_time'=>276.440,'target_text'=>'road.','source_text'=>'jalan raya.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>276.480,'end_time'=>279.700,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think the road is really used by any vehicles.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa jalan raya tidak digunakan oleh sebarang kenderaan.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>279.800,'end_time'=>282.260,'target_text'=>'It looks like a very quiet road overall.','source_text'=>'Ia kelihatan seperti jalan yang sangat sunyi secara keseluruhannya.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>282.360,'end_time'=>284.260,'target_text'=>'But most families here seem happy.','source_text'=>'Tetapi kebanyakan keluarga di sini kelihatan gembira.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>284.360,'end_time'=>286.780,'target_text'=>'I see one family and another over there.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak satu keluarga dan satu lagi di sana.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>286.880,'end_time'=>293.220,'target_text'=>'I think they\'re just enjoying the beautiful weather and having fun with their family out here.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa mereka hanya menikmati cuaca yang indah dan berseronok dengan keluarga mereka di luar sini.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>293.320,'end_time'=>297.380,'target_text'=>'Now I\'m going to teach you some of the most common emotions in pairs.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan mengajar anda beberapa emosi biasa secara berpasangan.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>297.480,'end_time'=>299.900,'target_text'=>'For example, happy and sad.','source_text'=>'Sebagai contoh, gembira dan sedih.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>300.000,'end_time'=>305.460,'target_text'=>'That way it\'s easier to remember them because one is usually the opposite of another.','source_text'=>'Dengan cara itu lebih mudah untuk mengingatinya kerana satu biasanya adalah lawan kepada yang lain.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>305.560,'end_time'=>308.020,'target_text'=>'The first pair, we already talked about it earlier.','source_text'=>'Pasangan pertama, kita sudah bercakap mengenainya tadi.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>308.120,'end_time'=>309.180,'target_text'=>'It is happy.','source_text'=>'Ia adalah gembira.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>309.280,'end_time'=>309.680,'target_text'=>'I\'m happy.','source_text'=>'I\'m happy.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>309.760,'end_time'=>310.780,'target_text'=>'I\'m so happy.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat gembira.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>310.880,'end_time'=>312.880,'target_text'=>'And sad.','source_text'=>'Dan sedih.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>313.640,'end_time'=>314.380,'target_text'=>'I\'m sad.','source_text'=>'Saya sedih.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>314.480,'end_time'=>315.540,'target_text'=>'Happy and sad.','source_text'=>'Gembira dan sedih.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>315.640,'end_time'=>318.180,'target_text'=>'The second is calm.','source_text'=>'Yang kedua adalah tenang.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>318.280,'end_time'=>319.260,'target_text'=>'I\'m calm.','source_text'=>'Saya tenang.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>319.360,'end_time'=>321.320,'target_text'=>'And stressed.','source_text'=>'Dan tertekan (stressed).','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>321.720,'end_time'=>322.220,'target_text'=>'I\'m stressed.','source_text'=>'I\'m stressed.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>322.320,'end_time'=>323.260,'target_text'=>'I\'m stressed out.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat tertekan.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>323.360,'end_time'=>324.860,'target_text'=>'I feel so stressed.','source_text'=>'Saya berasa sangat tertekan.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>324.960,'end_time'=>325.620,'target_text'=>'Stressed.','source_text'=>'Tertekan.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>325.720,'end_time'=>326.980,'target_text'=>'How good is that acting?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana lakonan itu?','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>327.080,'end_time'=>327.700,'target_text'=>'>> That was good acting.','source_text'=>'Lakonan yang baik.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>327.800,'end_time'=>328.540,'target_text'=>'>> Rate it 1 to 10.','source_text'=>'Nilaikan 1 hingga 10.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>328.640,'end_time'=>329.540,'target_text'=>'Was that believable?','source_text'=>'Adakah ia boleh dipercayai?','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>329.640,'end_time'=>332.900,'target_text'=>'For these next ones, I want you guys to guess the emotion.','source_text'=>'For these next ones, I want you guys to guess the emotion.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>333.000,'end_time'=>336.780,'target_text'=>'You don\'t need to guess it in English, but just think about what the emotion probably is.','source_text'=>'Anda tidak perlu meneka dalam Bahasa Inggeris, tetapi fikirkan emosi apa yang mungkin berlaku.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>336.880,'end_time'=>339.260,'target_text'=>'Oh man, I cannot wait to go do that.','source_text'=>'Aduh, saya tidak sabar untuk pergi lakukan itu.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>339.360,'end_time'=>343.260,'target_text'=>'I\'m so I\'m looking forward to it.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat — saya menantikannya.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>343.360,'end_time'=>344.220,'target_text'=>'Excited.','source_text'=>'Teruja.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>344.320,'end_time'=>345.500,'target_text'=>'I\'m excited.','source_text'=>'Saya teruja.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>345.600,'end_time'=>348.080,'target_text'=>'Now, the opposite.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, yang sebaliknya.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>349.160,'end_time'=>351.160,'target_text'=>'Oh, man.','source_text'=>'Aduh.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>351.400,'end_time'=>352.900,'target_text'=>'I I don\'t really want to go.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak berapa mahu pergi.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>353.000,'end_time'=>353.780,'target_text'=>'No, I\'m okay.','source_text'=>'Tak apa, saya okay.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>353.880,'end_time'=>354.500,'target_text'=>'I don\'t I don\'t want to go.','source_text'=>'Saya — saya tidak mahu pergi.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>354.600,'end_time'=>355.940,'target_text'=>'I don\'t want to go.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak mahu pergi.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>356.040,'end_time'=>357.380,'target_text'=>'Nervous.','source_text'=>'Gugup.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>357.480,'end_time'=>358.340,'target_text'=>'Nervous.','source_text'=>'Gugup.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>358.440,'end_time'=>360.380,'target_text'=>'Excited and nervous.','source_text'=>'Teruja dan gugup.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>360.480,'end_time'=>362.380,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I did that.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya lakukan itu.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>362.480,'end_time'=>364.700,'target_text'=>'That was me and I did it.','source_text'=>'Itu adalah saya dan saya berjaya melakukannya.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>364.800,'end_time'=>365.700,'target_text'=>'Proud.','source_text'=>'Bangga.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>365.800,'end_time'=>367.180,'target_text'=>'I\'m proud.','source_text'=>'Saya bangga.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>367.280,'end_time'=>368.420,'target_text'=>'Oh, man.','source_text'=>'Aduh.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>368.520,'end_time'=>371.180,'target_text'=>'I I wish I didn\'t do that.','source_text'=>'Saya harap saya tidak melakukannya.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>371.280,'end_time'=>372.260,'target_text'=>'Oh, no.','source_text'=>'Oh, tidak.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>372.360,'end_time'=>373.620,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak tahu.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>373.720,'end_time'=>374.740,'target_text'=>'Embarrassed.','source_text'=>'Malu.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>374.840,'end_time'=>375.820,'target_text'=>'Proud and embarrassed.','source_text'=>'Bangga dan malu.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>375.920,'end_time'=>378.500,'target_text'=>'These next ones we\'re just going to rapid fire through them.','source_text'=>'Seterusnya kita akan teruskan dengan pantas.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>378.600,'end_time'=>379.940,'target_text'=>'So, lock in.','source_text'=>'Fokus.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>380.040,'end_time'=>382.700,'target_text'=>'Relaxed and worried.','source_text'=>'Tenang dan bimbang.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>382.800,'end_time'=>384.980,'target_text'=>'Relaxed worried.','source_text'=>'Tenang dan bimbang.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>385.080,'end_time'=>387.940,'target_text'=>'Surprised and confused.','source_text'=>'Terkejut dan keliru.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>388.040,'end_time'=>391.060,'target_text'=>'Angry and frustrated.','source_text'=>'Marah dan kecewa.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>391.160,'end_time'=>394.280,'target_text'=>'Grateful disappointed.','source_text'=>'Bersyukur dan kecewa.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>395.280,'end_time'=>397.940,'target_text'=>'So, those are eight common pairs.','source_text'=>'Jadi, itu adalah lapan pasangan biasa.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>398.040,'end_time'=>399.500,'target_text'=>'Eight common pairs.','source_text'=>'Lapan pasangan biasa.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>399.600,'end_time'=>404.060,'target_text'=>'These are five different sentence structures to talk about emotions.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah lima struktur ayat yang berbeza untuk bercakap tentang emosi.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>404.160,'end_time'=>407.500,'target_text'=>'The first is I\'m plus the emotion.','source_text'=>'Yang pertama ialah I\'m ditambah dengan emosi.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>407.600,'end_time'=>408.740,'target_text'=>'I\'m happy.','source_text'=>'Saya gembira.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>408.840,'end_time'=>410.260,'target_text'=>'I\'m sad.','source_text'=>'Saya sedih.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>410.360,'end_time'=>411.580,'target_text'=>'I\'m excited.','source_text'=>'Saya teruja.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>411.680,'end_time'=>415.820,'target_text'=>'The second way is I feel plus emotion.','source_text'=>'Cara kedua ialah I feel ditambah dengan emosi.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>415.920,'end_time'=>417.540,'target_text'=>'I feel sad.','source_text'=>'Saya berasa sedih.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>417.640,'end_time'=>419.700,'target_text'=>'I feel stressed.','source_text'=>'Saya berasa tertekan.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>419.800,'end_time'=>423.860,'target_text'=>'The third I\'m feeling plus the emotion.','source_text'=>'Ketiga, I\'m feeling ditambah dengan emosi.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>423.960,'end_time'=>426.340,'target_text'=>'I\'m feeling tired today.','source_text'=>'Saya berasa penat hari ini.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>426.440,'end_time'=>428.860,'target_text'=>'I\'m feeling very stressed today.','source_text'=>'Saya berasa sangat tertekan hari ini.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>428.960,'end_time'=>436.580,'target_text'=>'The fourth is I feel emotion because I feel happy because I\'m with my friends.','source_text'=>'Keempat ialah I feel [emosi] because — Saya berasa gembira kerana saya bersama kawan-kawan.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>436.680,'end_time'=>439.740,'target_text'=>'I feel happy because','source_text'=>'I feel happy because','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>439.840,'end_time'=>441.700,'target_text'=>'I passed my test.','source_text'=>'saya lulus ujian saya.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>441.800,'end_time'=>445.900,'target_text'=>'And the final way is it makes me feel emotion.','source_text'=>'Dan cara terakhir ialah it makes me feel [emosi].','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>446.000,'end_time'=>448.740,'target_text'=>'Listening to music makes me feel happy.','source_text'=>'Mendengar muzik membuatkan saya berasa gembira.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>448.840,'end_time'=>450.660,'target_text'=>'It makes me feel sad.','source_text'=>'Ia membuatkan saya berasa sedih.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>450.760,'end_time'=>452.820,'target_text'=>'It makes me feel excited.','source_text'=>'Ia membuatkan saya berasa teruja.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>452.920,'end_time'=>458.340,'target_text'=>'So, those are five different sentence structures that you can use to talk about your emotions.','source_text'=>'Jadi, itu adalah lima struktur ayat berbeza yang boleh anda gunakan untuk bercakap tentang emosi anda.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>458.440,'end_time'=>460.940,'target_text'=>'Try out some of them and put it in the comments.','source_text'=>'Cuba beberapa daripadanya dan tulis di ruangan komen.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>461.040,'end_time'=>464.580,'target_text'=>'Now, when we speak in English we don\'t always say just I\'m sad.','source_text'=>'Kini, apabila kita bercakap dalam Bahasa Inggeris kita tidak sentiasa berkata \'I\'m sad\' sahaja.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>464.680,'end_time'=>465.780,'target_text'=>'I\'m happy like this.','source_text'=>'Atau \'I\'m happy\' seperti ini.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>465.880,'end_time'=>471.940,'target_text'=>'We usually add intensity words to say if we\'re feeling very sad or not very sad.','source_text'=>'Kita biasanya menambah perkataan penunjuk tahap intensiti untuk menyatakan sama ada kita merasa sangat sedih atau tidak begitu sedih.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>472.040,'end_time'=>475.340,'target_text'=>'So, here are some intensity words you can use.','source_text'=>'Jadi, berikut adalah beberapa perkataan intensiti yang boleh anda gunakan.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>475.440,'end_time'=>476.460,'target_text'=>'A little.','source_text'=>'Sedikit.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>476.560,'end_time'=>478.060,'target_text'=>'I\'m a little tired.','source_text'=>'Saya sedikit penat.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>478.160,'end_time'=>479.300,'target_text'=>'I\'m a little sad.','source_text'=>'Saya sedikit sedih.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>479.400,'end_time'=>482.300,'target_text'=>'That just means not very much.','source_text'=>'Itu bermaksud tidak berapa banyak.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>482.400,'end_time'=>484.100,'target_text'=>'I\'m a little sad today.','source_text'=>'Saya sedikit sedih hari ini.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>484.200,'end_time'=>486.740,'target_text'=>'Compared to I\'m very sad today.','source_text'=>'Berbanding dengan saya sangat sedih hari ini.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>486.840,'end_time'=>488.140,'target_text'=>'I\'m very sad today.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat sedih hari ini.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>488.240,'end_time'=>489.500,'target_text'=>'I\'m so sad.','source_text'=>'Saya tersangat sedih.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>489.600,'end_time'=>491.860,'target_text'=>'Another one is kind of.','source_text'=>'Satu lagi ialah jenis (kind of).','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>491.960,'end_time'=>493.500,'target_text'=>'I\'m kind of tired.','source_text'=>'Saya agak penat.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>493.600,'end_time'=>494.980,'target_text'=>'I\'m kind of excited.','source_text'=>'Saya agak teruja.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>495.080,'end_time'=>495.940,'target_text'=>'It\'s just not really a lot.','source_text'=>'Ia tidaklah terlalu banyak.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>496.040,'end_time'=>496.940,'target_text'=>'I\'m kind of.','source_text'=>'Saya agak.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>497.040,'end_time'=>498.020,'target_text'=>'Another one is pretty.','source_text'=>'Satu lagi ialah cukup (pretty).','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>498.120,'end_time'=>499.660,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty excited to go.','source_text'=>'Saya cukup teruja untuk pergi.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>499.760,'end_time'=>500.940,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty sad.','source_text'=>'Saya agak sedih.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>501.040,'end_time'=>502.260,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty happy.','source_text'=>'Saya agak gembira.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>502.360,'end_time'=>506.300,'target_text'=>'It\'s a little bit higher higher up than saying a bit.','source_text'=>'Ia sedikit lebih tinggi berbanding menyebut \'a bit\'.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>506.400,'end_time'=>508.340,'target_text'=>'And even higher than that is I\'m really.','source_text'=>'Dan lebih tinggi daripada itu ialah \'really\' (sungguh).','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>508.440,'end_time'=>509.540,'target_text'=>'I\'m really excited.','source_text'=>'Saya sungguh teruja.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>509.640,'end_time'=>511.060,'target_text'=>'I\'m really happy.','source_text'=>'Saya sungguh gembira.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>511.160,'end_time'=>511.860,'target_text'=>'I\'m really.','source_text'=>'Saya sungguh.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>511.960,'end_time'=>513.460,'target_text'=>'That\'s a stronger emotion.','source_text'=>'Itu menunjukkan emosi yang lebih kuat.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>513.560,'end_time'=>517.100,'target_text'=>'That just shows a stronger emotion and intensity.','source_text'=>'Ia menunjukkan emosi dan intensiti yang lebih kuat.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>517.200,'end_time'=>518.140,'target_text'=>'Really.','source_text'=>'Sungguh.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>518.240,'end_time'=>520.420,'target_text'=>'And finally, very.','source_text'=>'Dan akhir sekali, sangat (very).','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>520.520,'end_time'=>522.820,'target_text'=>'I am very sad.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat sedih.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>522.920,'end_time'=>524.540,'target_text'=>'I am very sad.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat sedih.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>524.640,'end_time'=>526.100,'target_text'=>'I am very happy.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat gembira.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>526.200,'end_time'=>527.380,'target_text'=>'I am very excited.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat teruja.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>527.480,'end_time'=>529.140,'target_text'=>'I am very stressed.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat tertekan.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>529.240,'end_time'=>531.380,'target_text'=>'It just means like a lot.','source_text'=>'Ia hanya bermaksud sangat banyak.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>531.480,'end_time'=>533.080,'target_text'=>'I\'m very very.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat sangat.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>533.180,'end_time'=>536.100,'target_text'=>'>> [snorts] >> What about extremely?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana pula dengan teramat sangat (extremely)?','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>536.200,'end_time'=>537.220,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s even higher.','source_text'=>'Itu jauh lebih tinggi.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>537.320,'end_time'=>538.780,'target_text'=>'I\'m extremely sad.','source_text'=>'Saya teramat sedih.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>538.880,'end_time'=>540.100,'target_text'=>'I\'m extremely sad.','source_text'=>'Saya teramat sedih.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>540.200,'end_time'=>541.940,'target_text'=>'I\'m extremely tired.','source_text'=>'Saya teramat penat.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>542.040,'end_time'=>542.740,'target_text'=>'Even higher.','source_text'=>'Lebih tinggi lagi.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>542.840,'end_time'=>543.780,'target_text'=>'Good one.','source_text'=>'Penambahan yang bagus.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>543.880,'end_time'=>545.540,'target_text'=>'Good one.','source_text'=>'Penambahan yang bagus.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>545.640,'end_time'=>548.100,'target_text'=>'Now, I have some questions to ask you guys.','source_text'=>'Kini, saya ada beberapa soalan untuk diajukan kepada anda semua.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>548.200,'end_time'=>552.300,'target_text'=>'I want you to try to answer these questions with everything you\'ve learned so far.','source_text'=>'Saya mahu anda cuba menjawab soalan ini dengan semua yang telah anda pelajari setakat ini.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>552.400,'end_time'=>553.260,'target_text'=>'Okay?','source_text'=>'Boleh?','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>553.360,'end_time'=>554.740,'target_text'=>'First question.','source_text'=>'Soalan pertama.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>554.840,'end_time'=>555.940,'target_text'=>'How are you?','source_text'=>'Apa khabar?','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>556.040,'end_time'=>556.660,'target_text'=>'How are you?','source_text'=>'How are you?','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>556.760,'end_time'=>558.060,'target_text'=>'Just a normal question.','source_text'=>'Hanya soalan biasa.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>558.160,'end_time'=>560.260,'target_text'=>'This is a very common question in English.','source_text'=>'Ini soalan yang sangat biasa dalam Bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>560.360,'end_time'=>561.980,'target_text'=>'How are you?','source_text'=>'Apa khabar?','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>562.080,'end_time'=>563.940,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m doing great.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat baik.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>564.040,'end_time'=>564.660,'target_text'=>'>> Perfect.','source_text'=>'Sempurna.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>564.760,'end_time'=>566.940,'target_text'=>'How are you feeling?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana perasaan anda?','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>567.040,'end_time'=>569.180,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m feeling hot right now.','source_text'=>'Saya berasa panas sekarang.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>569.280,'end_time'=>570.980,'target_text'=>'>> Are you okay?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda okay?','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>571.080,'end_time'=>572.860,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, I think I\'m okay.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya rasa saya okay.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>572.960,'end_time'=>575.740,'target_text'=>'>> Why are you so happy?','source_text'=>'Kenapa anda sangat gembira?','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>575.840,'end_time'=>578.120,'target_text'=>'>> Because I\'m traveling.','source_text'=>'Kerana saya sedang mengembara.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>578.440,'end_time'=>579.900,'target_text'=>'>> Because you\'re in Indonesia.','source_text'=>'Kerana anda berada di Indonesia.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>580.000,'end_time'=>580.280,'target_text'=>'Hey, yo.','source_text'=>'Hey, yo.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>580.280,'end_time'=>581.780,'target_text'=>'Let me know if you\'re in Indonesia.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya jika anda berada di Indonesia.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>581.880,'end_time'=>585.060,'target_text'=>'Shout out to everyone in Indonesia and from Indonesia.','source_text'=>'Salam hormat kepada semua di Indonesia dan dari Indonesia.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>585.160,'end_time'=>587.240,'target_text'=>'What\'s wrong?','source_text'=>'Apa yang tak kena?','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>587.400,'end_time'=>588.860,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m sweating too much.','source_text'=>'Saya berpeluh terlalu banyak.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>588.960,'end_time'=>589.620,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>589.720,'end_time'=>591.580,'target_text'=>'Are you nervous?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda gugup?','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>591.680,'end_time'=>592.860,'target_text'=>'>> Not really.','source_text'=>'Tidak juga.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>592.960,'end_time'=>595.580,'target_text'=>'>> When do you get nervous?','source_text'=>'Bila masanya anda menjadi gugup?','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>595.680,'end_time'=>598.780,'target_text'=>'>> When I\'m almost late for my flight at the airport.','source_text'=>'Apabila saya hampir lewat untuk menaiki penerbangan saya di lapangan terbang.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>598.880,'end_time'=>599.580,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>599.680,'end_time'=>600.940,'target_text'=>'Very good one.','source_text'=>'Jawapan yang sangat bagus.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>601.040,'end_time'=>603.600,'target_text'=>'Do you feel stressed?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda merasa tertekan?','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>603.760,'end_time'=>605.740,'target_text'=>'>> Sometimes, yes.','source_text'=>'Kadang-kadang, ya.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>605.840,'end_time'=>608.460,'target_text'=>'>> Do you feel stressed right now?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda merasa tertekan sekarang?','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>608.560,'end_time'=>609.100,'target_text'=>'>> Right now?','source_text'=>'Sekarang?','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>609.200,'end_time'=>610.340,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Tidak.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>610.440,'end_time'=>613.640,'target_text'=>'>> What is your favorite emotion?','source_text'=>'Apakah emosi kegemaran anda?','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>614.160,'end_time'=>615.900,'target_text'=>'>> Happy.','source_text'=>'Gembira.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>616.000,'end_time'=>619.060,'target_text'=>'>> Don\'t just watch this lesson and forget it.','source_text'=>'Jangan sekadar menonton pelajaran ini dan kemudian melupakannya.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>619.160,'end_time'=>626.380,'target_text'=>'Get the workbook for this video on my website and practice everything from the lesson more deeply.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku latihan untuk video ini di laman web saya dan latih segala-galanya daripada pelajaran ini dengan lebih mendalam.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>626.480,'end_time'=>636.020,'target_text'=>'Inside, you\'ll review the grammar, vocabulary, tenses, sentence patterns, comprehension questions, and real English from this','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya, anda akan menyemak tatabahasa, kosa kata, kala, struktur ayat, soalan pemahaman, dan Bahasa Inggeris yang sebenar daripada','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>636.120,'end_time'=>640.500,'target_text'=>'video with clear explanations and exercises.','source_text'=>'video ini berserta dengan penjelasan dan latihan yang jelas.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>640.600,'end_time'=>645.860,'target_text'=>'Watching helps you understand, but practicing helps you remember.','source_text'=>'Menonton membantu anda memahami, tetapi berlatih membantu anda mengingat.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>645.960,'end_time'=>651.100,'target_text'=>'And when you buy five or more workbooks, you automatically get 30% off at checkout.','source_text'=>'Dan apabila anda membeli lima atau lebih buku latihan, anda secara automatik mendapat diskaun 30% semasa pembayaran.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>651.200,'end_time'=>654.900,'target_text'=>'The link is in the description or at vulkanenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Pautannya ada di bahagian penerangan atau di volkaenglish.com.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>655.000,'end_time'=>659.740,'target_text'=>'Okay, now let\'s go over some common mistakes people make when talking about emotions.','source_text'=>'Okay, sekarang mari kita lihat beberapa kesilapan lazim yang dilakukan orang semasa bercakap tentang emosi.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>659.840,'end_time'=>662.500,'target_text'=>'The first one, I am feel happy.','source_text'=>'Yang pertama, \'I am feel happy\'.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>662.600,'end_time'=>664.100,'target_text'=>'I am feel happy.','source_text'=>'Saya \'am feel happy\'.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>664.200,'end_time'=>665.340,'target_text'=>'This is incorrect.','source_text'=>'Ini salah.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>665.440,'end_time'=>666.140,'target_text'=>'Incorrect.','source_text'=>'Salah.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>666.240,'end_time'=>671.340,'target_text'=>'The correct way to say this is I feel happy or I am happy.','source_text'=>'Cara betul untuk menyebutnya adalah \'I feel happy\' atau \'I am happy\'.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>671.440,'end_time'=>672.060,'target_text'=>'Either one.','source_text'=>'Salah satu daripadanya.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>672.160,'end_time'=>674.980,'target_text'=>'The second one, I have nervous.','source_text'=>'Yang kedua, \'I have nervous\'.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>675.080,'end_time'=>676.940,'target_text'=>'I have nervous.','source_text'=>'Saya \'have nervous\'.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>677.040,'end_time'=>681.460,'target_text'=>'The correct way to say it is I\'m nervous or I am nervous.','source_text'=>'Cara betul menyebutnya adalah \'I\'m nervous\' atau \'I am nervous\'.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>681.560,'end_time'=>684.580,'target_text'=>'Third mistake, I\'m very stress.','source_text'=>'Kesilapan ketiga, \'I\'m very stress\'.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>684.680,'end_time'=>686.180,'target_text'=>'I\'m very stress.','source_text'=>'Saya \'very stress\'.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>686.280,'end_time'=>686.980,'target_text'=>'That\'s incorrect.','source_text'=>'Itu tidak betul.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>687.080,'end_time'=>690.540,'target_text'=>'The correct way to say that is I\'m very stressed.','source_text'=>'Cara betul menyebutnya adalah \'I\'m very stressed\'.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>690.640,'end_time'=>692.980,'target_text'=>'Stressed, not stress.','source_text'=>'Stressed, bukannya stress.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>693.080,'end_time'=>694.020,'target_text'=>'Stressed.','source_text'=>'Stressed.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>694.120,'end_time'=>697.500,'target_text'=>'The fourth mistake is I am exciting.','source_text'=>'Kesilapan keempat ialah \'I am exciting\'.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>697.600,'end_time'=>698.860,'target_text'=>'I am exciting.','source_text'=>'Saya \'am exciting\'.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>698.960,'end_time'=>702.100,'target_text'=>'The correct version is I am excited.','source_text'=>'Versi yang betul adalah \'I am excited\'.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>702.200,'end_time'=>704.580,'target_text'=>'Excited, not exciting.','source_text'=>'Excited, bukannya exciting.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>704.680,'end_time'=>708.580,'target_text'=>'The final most common mistake is he feel sad.','source_text'=>'Kesilapan lazim terakhir ialah \'he feel sad\'.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>708.680,'end_time'=>709.940,'target_text'=>'He feel sad.','source_text'=>'Dia \'feel sad\'.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>710.040,'end_time'=>711.820,'target_text'=>'That sounds like a caveman speaking.','source_text'=>'Itu terdengar seperti orang zaman purba bercakap.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>711.920,'end_time'=>714.500,'target_text'=>'It\'s he [music] feels sad.','source_text'=>'Ia sepatutnya \'he feels sad\'.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>714.600,'end_time'=>716.260,'target_text'=>'He feels sad.','source_text'=>'Dia \'feels sad\'.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>716.360,'end_time'=>719.660,'target_text'=>'Now we are going to have a shadowing conversation.','source_text'=>'Kini kita akan melakukan latihan perbualan bayangan.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>719.760,'end_time'=>724.820,'target_text'=>'I will read the blue, you read the yellow caption below.','source_text'=>'Saya akan membaca bahagian biru, anda membaca teks kuning di bawah.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>724.920,'end_time'=>727.000,'target_text'=>'Are you ready?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda bersedia?','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>727.160,'end_time'=>730.360,'target_text'=>'Hey, how are you feeling today?','source_text'=>'Hey, bagaimana perasaan anda hari ini?','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>731.760,'end_time'=>733.500,'target_text'=>'Yeah, you look a little tired.','source_text'=>'Ya, anda kelihatan sedikit penat.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>733.600,'end_time'=>736.160,'target_text'=>'Did you sleep late?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda tidur lewat?','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>738.720,'end_time'=>739.540,'target_text'=>'That makes sense.','source_text'=>'Itu masuk akal.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>739.640,'end_time'=>744.240,'target_text'=>'I\'m kind of tired, too, but I\'m also really happy today.','source_text'=>'Saya juga agak penat, tetapi saya juga sangat gembira hari ini.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>745.760,'end_time'=>751.560,'target_text'=>'Because the weather is beautiful and this kind of morning makes me feel relaxed.','source_text'=>'Kerana cuacanya indah dan pagi seperti ini membuatkan saya berasa tenang.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>753.600,'end_time'=>754.300,'target_text'=>'Same.','source_text'=>'Sama juga.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>754.400,'end_time'=>758.360,'target_text'=>'Yesterday I felt so stressed, though.','source_text'=>'Yesterday I felt so stressed, though.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>759.640,'end_time'=>764.040,'target_text'=>'Because I had too many things to do and I just felt overwhelmed.','source_text'=>'Kerana saya ada terlalu banyak benda untuk dilakukan dan saya rasa sangat terbeban.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>766.000,'end_time'=>766.860,'target_text'=>'Exactly.','source_text'=>'Tepat sekali.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>766.960,'end_time'=>771.080,'target_text'=>'But right now I feel much calmer.','source_text'=>'Tetapi sekarang saya berasa jauh lebih tenang.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>773.800,'end_time'=>775.460,'target_text'=>'That\'s a great feeling.','source_text'=>'Itu satu perasaan yang sangat hebat.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>775.560,'end_time'=>779.860,'target_text'=>'Now let\'s move on to the second dialogue talking before something important.','source_text'=>'Kini mari kita beralih ke dialog kedua bercakap sebelum perkara penting.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>779.960,'end_time'=>780.940,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get into it.','source_text'=>'Mari kita mulakan.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>781.040,'end_time'=>782.100,'target_text'=>'You look serious.','source_text'=>'Anda kelihatan serius.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>782.200,'end_time'=>784.400,'target_text'=>'How are you feeling?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana perasaan anda?','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>786.560,'end_time'=>789.080,'target_text'=>'Why are you nervous?','source_text'=>'Kenapa anda gugup?','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>791.960,'end_time'=>793.300,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that\'s normal.','source_text'=>'Ya, itu biasa.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>793.400,'end_time'=>798.960,'target_text'=>'Big moments can make you feel excited and worried at the same time.','source_text'=>'Detik-detik penting boleh membuatkan anda berasa teruja dan bimbang pada masa yang sama.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>799.360,'end_time'=>803.000,'target_text'=>'That can definitely make you feel stressed.','source_text'=>'Itu pasti boleh membuatkan anda berasa tertekan.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>803.920,'end_time'=>806.800,'target_text'=>'So what helps you feel better?','source_text'=>'Jadi apa yang membantu anda berasa lebih baik?','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>808.360,'end_time'=>809.060,'target_text'=>'That\'s good.','source_text'=>'Itu bagus.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>809.160,'end_time'=>812.440,'target_text'=>'Do you feel hopeful, too?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda merasa penuh harapan juga?','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>814.480,'end_time'=>816.840,'target_text'=>'That\'s a good combination.','source_text'=>'Itu gabungan yang baik.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>818.440,'end_time'=>819.540,'target_text'=>'You should feel proud.','source_text'=>'Anda patut berasa bangga.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>819.640,'end_time'=>822.180,'target_text'=>'That\'s a strong mindset.','source_text'=>'Itu minda yang sangat kuat.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>822.280,'end_time'=>824.340,'target_text'=>'Hopefully you guys enjoyed that shadowing dialogue.','source_text'=>'Diharapkan anda semua menikmati dialog bayangan tersebut.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>824.440,'end_time'=>831.020,'target_text'=>'If you liked it and you want more, let me know in the comments and I will include them in all my videos going into the future.','source_text'=>'Jika anda menyukainya dan mahukan lagi, beritahu saya di ruangan komen dan saya akan memasukkannya dalam semua video saya pada masa hadapan.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>831.120,'end_time'=>832.620,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, what are you working on?','source_text'=>'Yo, apa yang kau sedang usahakan?','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>832.720,'end_time'=>834.540,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, I\'m working on my channel right now.','source_text'=>'Yo, aku tengah usahakan saluran aku sekarang.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>834.640,'end_time'=>835.340,'target_text'=>'Okay, I just started.','source_text'=>'Okay, aku baru sahaja bermula.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>835.440,'end_time'=>837.620,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to be posting once a week if you guys want to check it out.','source_text'=>'Aku akan pos seminggu sekali jika anda semua mahu melihatnya.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>837.720,'end_time'=>842.020,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ll be posting my shadowing stories on my second channel, Volka.','source_text'=>'Aku akan memuat naik cerita bayangan aku di saluran kedua aku, Volka.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>842.120,'end_time'=>845.460,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve also started posting these videos as podcasts.','source_text'=>'Dan aku juga telah mula memuat naik video-video ini sebagai podcast.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>845.560,'end_time'=>848.820,'target_text'=>'Do you understand English but feel nervous when you speak?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda memahami Bahasa Inggeris tetapi berasa gugup apabila bercakap?','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>848.920,'end_time'=>856.780,'target_text'=>'Join my Patreon for my speaking, pronunciation, and shadowing course with over 90 video lessons.','source_text'=>'Sertai Patreon saya untuk kursus bertuturan, sebutan, dan bayangan saya dengan lebih daripada 90 pelajaran video.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>856.880,'end_time'=>864.300,'target_text'=>'You\'ll practice pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking with step-by-step video lessons.','source_text'=>'Anda akan berlatih sebutan, loghat, rentak, dan pertuturan semula jadi dengan pelajaran video langkah demi langkah.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>864.400,'end_time'=>866.780,'target_text'=>'Plus, new lessons every week.','source_text'=>'Ditambah pula dengan pelajaran baru setiap minggu.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>866.880,'end_time'=>868.260,'target_text'=>'Get it in the description.','source_text'=>'Dapatkannya melalui bahagian penerangan.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>868.360,'end_time'=>872.580,'target_text'=>'Don\'t forget to get my 3,000 most common English words PDF in the description.','source_text'=>'Jangan lupa untuk mendapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan Bahasa Inggeris paling lazim di bahagian penerangan.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>872.680,'end_time'=>874.600,'target_text'=>'Bye, guys.','source_text'=>'Bye, kawan-kawan.','order'=>324],
        ] as $s) { $vid_qNsq7k8qJPQ->subtitles()->create($s); }

    }
